---
description: >-
  All 8 message-arrow variants (->>/-->>/->/-->/-x/--x/->>+/-->>+) between the
  same two participants.
config:
  look: classic
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A@{ "type" : "actor" }
  participant B@{ "type" : "boundary" }
  A ->> B: ->> message 0
  A -->> B: -->> message 1
  A -> B: -> message 2
  A --> B: --> message 3
  A -x B: -x message 4
  A --x B: --x message 5
  A ->>+ B: ->>+ message 6
  A -->>+ B: -->>+ message 7
